{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08077","headline":"来日大难 · 李白","name":"来日大难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来日一身，携粮负薪。\n道长食尽，苦口焦唇。\n今日醉饱，乐过千春。\n仙人相存，诱我远学。\n海淩三山，陆憩五岳。\n乘龙天飞，目瞻两角。\n授以仙药，金丹满握。\n蟪蛄蒙恩，深愧短促。\n思填东海，强衔一木。\n道重天地，轩师广成。\n蝉翼九五，以求长生。\n下士大笑，如苍蝇声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}